                          "q": "Where is Sun State International in Tampa?",
                          "a": "Sun State International Trucks, LLC. is at 6020 Adamo Drive, Tampa, FL 33619, just off Adamo Drive east of downtown Tampa. Phone (813) 621-1331, fax 813-628-0527."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What are the Tampa hours?",
                          "a": "Sales and parts are open 7:00 AM to 7:00 PM Monday through Friday and 8:00 AM to 12:00 PM Saturday. Service is open 7:00 AM to 7:00 PM Monday through Friday. Closed Sunday."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Is after-hours service available in Tampa?",
                          "a": "Yes. After hours service runs 8:00 PM to 5:00 AM via Certified Fleet at (863) 880-2206."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do you rent equipment from the Tampa location?",
                          "a": "Yes. For rentals call (813) 769-2549 or (813) 323-1026."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Can I buy trailers at the Tampa location?",
                          "a": "Yes. Sun State Trailers Trailer Sales shares the 6020 Adamo Drive address and is open 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM Monday through Friday, selling new and used Hyundai Translead and Globe Trailers. Call (813) 621-1331."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Where is the Tampa aftermarket facility?",
